{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>Elohim yireh-lo the sheep for an offering.</b> Even though it was said to Abraham, 'for in Isaac shall your seed be called,' he was afraid lest Isaac be slaughtered. He said: perhaps Isaac lay with a woman before the Akedah and begot a son or daughter, and thus 'for in Isaac shall your seed be called' is already fulfilled — for at that time he was already thirty-seven years old."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:05:15.353556687Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}